{
  "title": "TileNavigationSource",
  "description": "Tile data a TileNavigationSpace can navigate: a `TileLayer` from `@codexo/exojs-tilemap` matches it as it is, and so does any other grid that can answer what sits in a cell and when anything changed. Cell coordinates are integers; navigation coordinates are the logical space a cell `(x, y)` covers `[x, x + 1) * logicalTileWidth` of, shifted by logicalOffset - the same space tilemap physics colliders live in.",
